sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as Mobile App
  participant GAP as BLE GAP
  participant ATT as ATT / GATT
  participant DFU as DFU service
  participant Flash as Internal flash
  participant Boot as Bootloader

  User->>App: tap "Update firmware"
  App->>GAP: scan UUID 0xFE59
  GAP-->>App: ADV_IND (name, RSSI)
  App->>GAP: CONNECT_IND
  GAP-->>ATT: MTU exchange (247)
  App->>ATT: Discover services
  ATT-->>App: DFU 0xFE59 + CCCD 0x2902
  App->>ATT: Write CCCD notify
  App->>DFU: CTRL: START (image size, CRC)
  DFU->>Flash: erase inactive slot
  Flash-->>DFU: done
  DFU-->>App: RSP OK (offset 0)

  loop chunks of 244 bytes
    App->>DFU: DATA write-cmd
    DFU->>Flash: program page
    alt page complete
      DFU-->>App: notify progress
    else buffer full
      DFU-->>App: notify WAIT
      App->>App: pause 20ms
    end
  end

  App->>DFU: CTRL: VALIDATE
  DFU->>Flash: CRC32
  alt CRC match
    DFU->>Boot: set slot B active
    DFU-->>App: RSP SWAP
    App->>GAP: disconnect
    Boot->>Boot: reset into new image
  else CRC mismatch
    DFU-->>App: RSP FAIL
    Note over App,Flash: keep slot A, increment fail counter
  end
